Date: 2026-11-15
Scope: independent verification of the post-`SA_carbon_review_15` (round 25) consolidation on
`issue_63_v0.0.20` / commit `9f9c05c`. Sources audited: every file under `src/phonebridge/`
(`__init__.py`, `domain/__init__.py`, `domain/contract.py` — 4 235 lines, `py.typed`), all of
`tests/` (`test_domain_contract.py` 3 043 lines, `test_smoke.py`, `test_tooling_baseline.py`),
